{"id":1030302,"chapter_id":1030302,"scene_id":1,"steps":[{"step":1,"content":"从黑暗中醒来，你能意识到你似乎还在审查室里，但是你的周围模糊不堪。","style":3,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":130302001,"trial_step":1},{"step":2,"content":"鼻翼间是熟悉的臭味——来自锈河的味道。","style":3,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":130302002,"trial_step":2},{"step":3,"speaker":"？？？","content":"不要害怕，亲爱的，星穹剧场即将拉开帷幕~请拭目以待吧~！","voice":["vo_trial_30302_1_1"],"voice_bank":"vo_snake_trial","style":1,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":130302003,"trial_step":3},{"step":4,"content":"像是脑内传来的声音，拉回你的思绪——是娜恰，像是枷锁链接一般，你的所有感官，在她说完那句话后，都集中在了眼前的剧场里。","style":3,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":130302004,"trial_step":4},{"step":5,"speaker":"娜恰","content":"故事的第一幕……由此展开~","voice":["vo_trial_30302_1_2"],"voice_bank":"vo_snake_trial","style":1,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":130302005,"trial_step":5},{"step":6,"speaker":"商贩","content":"*文明锈河*，这破地方，到处都是怪物，也不知道这批“货”能不能活着到新城。","voice":["vo_trial_30302_1_3"],"voice_bank":"vo_snake_trial","style":1,"background":1019,"log_type":1,"src_id":130302006,"trial_step":6},{"step":7,"speaker":"商贩","content":"那些辛迪加蠢货，只要一听到有机会去新城，就会像苍蝇似的凑上来，赶都赶不走。","voice":["vo_trial_30302_1_4"],"voice_bank":"vo_snake_trial","style":1,"background":1019,"log_type":1,"src_id":130302007,"trial_step":7},{"step":8,"speaker":"商贩","content":"唉……算了，就算扒上来也没事，咱货舱里那几条宝贝可不是吃素的！","voice":["vo_trial_30302_1_5"],"voice_bank":"vo_snake_trial","style":1,"background":1019,"log_type":1,"src_id":130302008,"trial_step":8},{"step":9,"content":"眼前的景象逐渐清晰，那好像是在一辆集运卡车的货仓里，堆叠的大箱子中，一条漆黑的蛇，紧紧缠绕着个什么东西。","style":3,"background":1019,"log_type":1,"src_id":130302009,"trial_step":9},{"step":10,"speaker":"娜恰","content":"而我们的主角……在这里，开启了追逐快乐的旅程。","voice":["vo_trial_30302_1_6"],"voice_bank":"vo_snake_trial","style":1,"background":1019,"log_type":1,"src_id":130302010,"trial_step":10},{"step":11,"content":"你看见娜恰出现在你身旁，她指着长蛇让你看看仔细，你这才发现，被它遮住的是一个女孩。","style":3,"background":1019,"log_type":1,"src_id":130302011,"trial_step":11},{"step":12,"content":"那条蛇将头埋在她脖侧，不断地吐着信子，女孩嘴唇泛青，紧紧地掐住自己的手腕。","style":3,"background":1019,"log_type":1,"src_id":130302012,"trial_step":12},{"step":13,"speaker":"娜恰","content":"来，跟我一起观赏，一起……体验吧。","voice":["vo_trial_30302_1_7"],"voice_bank":"vo_snake_trial","style":1,"background":1019,"log_type":1,"src_id":130302013,"trial_step":13},{"step":14,"content":"娜恰的声音变得缥缈，而你的视线不知为何逐渐模糊起来，你似乎感受到了有什么缠绕在你身上。","style":3,"background":1001,"log_type":1,"src_id":130302014,"trial_step":14},{"step":15,"content":"枷锁链接的精神与意识，让你莫名地心跳加快，你感受到自己的皮肤被冰冷覆盖，刺痛从身体的各个地方传来，而这些感受，却又让你的眼前出现绮丽的幻影，让人沉醉。","style":3,"background":1001,"log_type":1,"src_id":130302015,"trial_step":15},{"step":16,"content":"你突然明白了——这是女孩的感受，和其他人一起偷偷扒进这趟卡车的货舱，却没想到他们运输的是蛇。","style":3,"background":1001,"log_type":1,"src_id":130302016,"trial_step":16},{"step":17,"speaker":"商贩","content":"这几条可都是上等“好货”，新城那帮傻*文明锈河*可是出了大价钱的，等交易完成，哥几个在新城过点“快乐生活”！","voice":["vo_trial_30302_1_8"],"voice_bank":"vo_snake_trial","style":1,"background":1001,"log_type":1,"src_id":130302017,"trial_step":17},{"step":18,"speaker":"女孩","content":"快乐……会是什么样的感受呢？","voice":["vo_trial_30302_1_9"],"voice_bank":"vo_snake_trial","style":1,"background":1001,"log_type":1,"src_id":130302018,"trial_step":18},{"step":19,"content":"男人粗鲁的通讯声从驾驶舱传来，女孩伸长了脖子，想要听得更仔细一点。","style":3,"background":1001,"log_type":1,"src_id":130302019,"trial_step":19},{"step":20,"speaker":"商贩","content":"咱们那破地方，要啥啥没有，再这么下去，得吃那些怪物生活了！但新城啊，到处都是吃喝玩乐的地方，你什么都不用考虑！","voice":["vo_trial_30302_1_10"],"voice_bank":"vo_snake_trial","style":1,"background":1001,"log_type":1,"src_id":130302020,"trial_step":20},{"step":21,"speaker":"商贩","content":"对！拿着这些钱，我们在新城玩个一辈子！数不尽的美食，看不尽的美女！想要什么就有什么！每天都是笑着过的！","voice":["vo_trial_30302_1_11"],"voice_bank":"vo_snake_trial","style":1,"background":1001,"log_type":1,"src_id":130302021,"trial_step":21},{"step":22,"speaker":"商贩","content":"那里，可是整个狄斯，最快乐的地方！","voice":["vo_trial_30302_1_12"],"voice_bank":"vo_snake_trial","style":1,"background":1001,"log_type":1,"src_id":130302022,"trial_step":22},{"step":23,"content":"商贩的话语伴随着蛇毒蔓延所带来的幻觉，女孩眼前的幻影愈发浓烈。","style":3,"background":1001,"log_type":1,"src_id":130302023,"trial_step":23},{"step":24,"speaker":"女孩","content":"新城……新城还能寻找到……快乐啊。","voice":["vo_trial_30302_1_13"],"voice_bank":"vo_snake_trial","style":1,"background":1001,"log_type":1,"src_id":130302024,"trial_step":24},{"step":25,"speaker":"女孩","content":"那我是不是……变得快乐，就不会……这么痛苦了？","voice":["vo_trial_30302_1_14"],"voice_bank":"vo_snake_trial","style":1,"background":1001,"log_type":1,"src_id":130302025,"trial_step":25},{"step":26,"content":"女孩的生命几乎流逝至尽头，可是看着眼前的景象，好像是被什么给刺激到一样，她有了活下去的动力——","style":3,"background":1001,"log_type":1,"src_id":130302026,"trial_step":26},{"step":27,"speaker":"女孩","content":"让我去变得快乐吧，让我……活下去！","voice":["vo_trial_30302_1_15"],"voice_bank":"vo_snake_trial","style":1,"background":1001,"log_type":1,"src_id":130302027,"trial_step":27},{"step":28,"content":"心脏的震动逐渐变强，你感受到自己的呼吸愈发急促。身体的各处都在变得剧痛，又伴随着噬骨一般的瘙痒。就像是你的身体中，又重新长出了另一副身体。","style":3,"background":1001,"log_type":1,"src_id":130302028,"trial_step":28},{"step":29,"content":"它想要冲破原本的桎梏，抛弃过去的软弱……","style":3,"background":1001,"log_type":1,"src_id":130302029,"trial_step":29},{"step":30,"content":"直到汗水浸湿了你的衣衫，这一切才停了下来——你艰难地抬眼看去，那个女孩已经挣脱出了蛇的怀抱，坐在它的身边。","style":3,"background":10005,"log_type":1,"src_id":130302030,"trial_step":30},{"step":31,"speaker":"女孩","content":"谢谢你……让我看到了那样的景象，我会得到这些快乐的，对吧？","voice":["vo_trial_30302_1_16"],"voice_bank":"vo_snake_trial","style":1,"background":10005,"log_type":1,"src_id":130302031,"trial_step":31},{"step":32,"content":"女孩轻抚着那条蛇，竖瞳之中，满是狂热的向往。而方才几乎要了她的命的蛇，如今却像一只真正的宠物那般，惧怕着她，甘心地臣服在她脚边。","style":3,"background":10005,"log_type":1,"src_id":130302032,"trial_step":32},{"step":33,"content":"你能感知到原因，蛇会惧怕她，是因为她身上拥有了非同寻常的力量，也因为她比这条蛇还要疯狂——她已经成为了一名禁闭者。","style":3,"background":10005,"log_type":1,"src_id":130302033,"trial_step":33},{"step":34,"content":"咚！咚！几声杂乱的铁锤声过后，一道道刺眼的白光射了进来。","style":3,"background":10005,"log_type":1,"src_id":130302034,"trial_step":34},{"step":35,"content":"你的眼睛承受不住突如其来的光亮，连忙举起手来遮挡。","style":3,"background":2016,"log_type":1,"src_id":130302035,"trial_step":35},{"step":36,"speaker":"男人","content":"*文明狄斯*，这是什么东西？","voice":["vo_trial_30302_1_17"],"voice_bank":"vo_snake_trial","style":1,"background":2016,"log_type":1,"src_id":130302036,"trial_step":36},{"step":37,"content":"白光散去，你看到两个人站在面前，打量着车上的东西。","style":3,"background":2016,"log_type":1,"src_id":130302037,"trial_step":37},{"step":38,"content":"另一个衣着光鲜的男人举着一台设备，对着木箱，像是在记录着什么。","style":3,"background":2016,"log_type":1,"src_id":130302038,"trial_step":38},{"step":39,"speaker":"男人","content":"啧，我买的是蛇，怎么还给我附带了这么多麻烦的家伙！还好我的直播按钮还没按下去，这要是被全世界看去了，你担待得起吗！","voice":["vo_trial_30302_1_18"],"voice_bank":"vo_snake_trial","style":1,"background":2016,"log_type":1,"src_id":130302039,"trial_step":39},{"step":40,"speaker":"商贩","content":"嘿，这些“货”可是猛得很，一开始普通的食物吃不惯！这不是我们贴心奉上的……过渡用的东西吗？","voice":["vo_trial_30302_1_19"],"voice_bank":"vo_snake_trial","style":1,"background":2016,"log_type":1,"src_id":130302040,"trial_step":40},{"step":41,"speaker":"男人","content":"哦！！！那很不错，那让我来给我的宝贝挑一个好看点的！","voice":["vo_trial_30302_1_20"],"voice_bank":"vo_snake_trial","style":1,"background":2016,"log_type":1,"src_id":130302041,"trial_step":41},{"step":42,"content":"听到二人的对话，车上那些“蠢货们”都不住地往后退去，有些甚至直接晕厥。","style":3,"background":2016,"log_type":1,"src_id":130302042,"trial_step":42},{"step":43,"content":"只有那个女孩，她站了起来，走到男人面前。","style":3,"background":2016,"log_type":1,"src_id":130302043,"trial_step":43},{"step":44,"speaker":"女孩","content":"你是新城的人？","voice":["vo_trial_30302_1_21"],"voice_bank":"vo_snake_trial","style":1,"background":2016,"log_type":1,"src_id":130302044,"trial_step":44},{"step":45,"speaker":"男人","content":"你还会说话？","voice":["vo_trial_30302_1_22"],"voice_bank":"vo_snake_trial","style":1,"background":2016,"log_type":1,"src_id":130302045,"trial_step":45},{"step":46,"speaker":"男人","content":"哼。这里就是大名鼎鼎的新城！能在挂之前看一眼，你已经很走运了。","voice":["vo_trial_30302_1_23"],"voice_bank":"vo_snake_trial","style":1,"background":2016,"log_type":1,"src_id":130302046,"trial_step":46},{"step":47,"speaker":"女孩","content":"你……带我一起走吧。","voice":["vo_trial_30302_1_24"],"voice_bank":"vo_snake_trial","style":1,"background":2016,"log_type":1,"src_id":130302047,"trial_step":47},{"step":48,"speaker":"男人","content":"哈？？你要不要听听你在说什么？","voice":["vo_trial_30302_1_25"],"voice_bank":"vo_snake_trial","style":1,"background":2016,"log_type":1,"src_id":130302048,"trial_step":48},{"step":49,"speaker":"女孩","content":"我想要在这里……寻找快乐。","voice":["vo_trial_30302_1_26"],"voice_bank":"vo_snake_trial","style":1,"background":2016,"log_type":1,"src_id":130302049,"trial_step":49},{"step":50,"speaker":"男人","content":"……你是疯子吧？不过你都这么说了……也不是不行。","voice":["vo_trial_30302_1_27"],"voice_bank":"vo_snake_trial","style":1,"background":2016,"log_type":1,"src_id":130302050,"trial_step":50},{"step":51,"speaker":"商贩","content":"那挺好的！正好你就和这位大哥哥的货住在一起呢，你们一定是很好的朋友，对吧。","voice":["vo_trial_30302_1_28"],"voice_bank":"vo_snake_trial","style":1,"background":2016,"log_type":1,"src_id":130302051,"trial_step":51},{"step":52,"speaker":"女孩","content":"朋友……是呀。","voice":["vo_trial_30302_1_29"],"voice_bank":"vo_snake_trial","style":1,"background":2016,"log_type":1,"src_id":130302052,"trial_step":52},{"step":53,"content":"女孩轻轻地笑了起来，露出尖尖的牙齿。","style":3,"background":2016,"log_type":1,"src_id":130302053,"trial_step":53},{"step":54,"content":"她贴在蛇的眼侧小声地说了些什么，只见原本还趴在地上的黑蛇，晃晃悠悠地将身子立了起来，直直地看着男人，吐起了信子。","style":3,"background":2016,"log_type":1,"src_id":130302054,"trial_step":54},{"step":55,"speaker":"男人","content":"等等……难道说、难道说你能跟蛇交流？！","voice":["vo_trial_30302_1_30"],"voice_bank":"vo_snake_trial","style":1,"background":2016,"log_type":1,"src_id":130302055,"trial_step":55},{"step":56,"speaker":"男人","content":"*文明狄斯*！！这个一定能爆红！！！","voice":["vo_trial_30302_1_31"],"voice_bank":"vo_snake_trial","style":1,"background":2016,"log_type":1,"src_id":130302056,"trial_step":56},{"step":57,"speaker":"男人","content":"你再多说一点！多说一点！！","voice":["vo_trial_30302_1_32"],"voice_bank":"vo_snake_trial","style":1,"background":2016,"log_type":1,"src_id":130302057,"trial_step":57},{"step":58,"content":"男人兴奋地举起手机，大声嚷嚷，不停地让这个女孩指挥蛇做点什么。","style":3,"background":2016,"log_type":1,"src_id":130302058,"trial_step":58},{"step":59,"content":"女孩一一照做，为了去往，她憧憬的快乐。","style":3,"background":2016,"log_type":1,"src_id":130302059,"trial_step":59},{"step":60,"content":"<color=#e45515>她就这样留了下来。</color>","style":14,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":130302060,"trial_step":60},{"step":61,"content":"从那天起，<color=#e45515>能与蛇交流的女孩</color>在网络上红了起来。","style":14,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":130302061,"trial_step":61},{"step":62,"content":"她没穿过的<color=#e45515>裙子</color>，没吃过的<color=#e45515>食物</color>，都因为这件事而得到了。","style":14,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":130302062,"trial_step":62},{"step":63,"content":"但是大家不知道的是……镜头之外，她仍然<color=#e45515>只能住在院子里</color>，毗邻宠物小屋的旁边。","style":14,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":130302063,"trial_step":63},{"step":64,"content":"<color=#e45515>没有人</color>在乎她的想法，<color=#e45515>没有人</color>明白她的感受……给予她温度的，<color=#e45515>只有</color>那条冷血的蛇。","style":14,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":130302064,"trial_step":64},{"step":65,"content":"剧场上，容纳这家人的房子渐渐变得<color=#e45515>更大</color>，甚至连宠物居住的小屋也一点点<color=#e45515>变大</color>。","style":14,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":130302065,"trial_step":65},{"step":66,"content":"<color=#e45515>而唯一不变的，只有依附在宠物房旁边的“窝”。</color>","style":14,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":130302066,"trial_step":66},{"step":67,"speaker":"男人","content":"哈，你这眼神什么意思？还想反抗不成？","voice":["vo_trial_30302_1_33"],"voice_bank":"vo_snake_trial","style":1,"background":3001,"log_type":1,"src_id":130302067,"trial_step":67},{"step":68,"speaker":"女孩","content":"我还以为……你能带给我快乐。","voice":["vo_trial_30302_1_34"],"voice_bank":"vo_snake_trial","style":1,"background":3001,"log_type":1,"src_id":130302068,"trial_step":68},{"step":69,"speaker":"女孩","content":"但我在你这里，得到的东西，不能让我笑着过每一天……那些让我很累，让我很痛苦……","voice":["vo_trial_30302_1_35"],"voice_bank":"vo_snake_trial","style":1,"background":3001,"log_type":1,"src_id":130302069,"trial_step":69},{"step":70,"speaker":"男人","content":"我留你一条命，是为了让你给我快乐！赚钱就是我的快乐！明白吗！","voice":["vo_trial_30302_1_36"],"voice_bank":"vo_snake_trial","style":1,"background":3001,"log_type":1,"src_id":130302070,"trial_step":70},{"step":71,"speaker":"男人","content":"你就给我老老实实的赚钱就行了！","voice":["vo_trial_30302_1_37"],"voice_bank":"vo_snake_trial","style":1,"background":3001,"log_type":1,"src_id":130302071,"trial_step":71},{"step":72,"content":"男人晕乎乎地，拿着瓶子走进自己房间。","style":3,"background":3001,"log_type":1,"src_id":130302072,"trial_step":72},{"step":73,"speaker":"男人","content":"我是你唯一的活路，别肖想那些你不配得到的东西了，我告诉你——","voice":["vo_trial_30302_1_38"],"voice_bank":"vo_snake_trial","style":1,"background":3001,"log_type":1,"src_id":130302073,"trial_step":73},{"step":74,"speaker":"“男人”","content":"现实就是如此，有些人生来就只配在脚底下待着。","voice":["vo_trial_30302_1_39"],"voice_bank":"vo_snake_trial","style":1,"background":3001,"log_type":1,"src_id":130302074,"trial_step":74},{"step":75,"content":"男人的声音和娜恰的声音重叠在了一起，门被狠狠关上。","style":3,"background":3001,"log_type":1,"src_id":130302075,"trial_step":75},{"step":76,"speaker":"女孩","content":"你想要快乐吗？我也想……","voice":["vo_trial_30302_1_40"],"voice_bank":"vo_snake_trial","style":1,"background":3001,"log_type":1,"src_id":130302076,"trial_step":76},{"step":77,"speaker":"女孩","content":"但能不能……用别的方式获得快乐呢？不要用伤害我的方式，不要摧毁我的快乐。那样是不对的……","voice":["vo_trial_30302_1_41"],"voice_bank":"vo_snake_trial","style":1,"background":3001,"log_type":1,"src_id":130302077,"trial_step":77},{"step":78,"content":"女孩静静地站在花园里，安静地遥望着天空。","style":3,"background":3001,"log_type":1,"src_id":130302078,"trial_step":78},{"step":79,"speaker":"女孩","content":"这样吧……我给你别的快乐，曾经我享受过的真正的快乐……你会喜欢的。","voice":["vo_trial_30302_1_42"],"voice_bank":"vo_snake_trial","style":1,"background":3001,"log_type":1,"src_id":130302079,"trial_step":79},{"step":80,"content":"剧场上，你看到整栋房子的门一扇一扇地关了起来，窸窸窣窣的声音响起，好像什么东西正在爬行。","style":3,"background":3001,"log_type":1,"src_id":130302080,"trial_step":80},{"step":81,"speaker":"女孩","content":"哈哈，梦幻，快乐，让这里都笼罩在快乐之下吧！","voice":["vo_trial_30302_1_43"],"voice_bank":"vo_snake_trial","style":1,"background":3001,"log_type":1,"src_id":130302081,"trial_step":81},{"step":82,"content":"一道蛇影穿过你的眼前，随后，那些房门下，渗出了点点液体，让地毯的颜色渐渐变深。","style":3,"background":3001,"log_type":1,"src_id":130302082,"trial_step":82},{"step":83,"speaker":"玩家","content":"这是……宠物蛇案件？","style":2,"background":3001,"log_type":1,"src_id":130302083,"trial_step":83},{"step":84,"speaker":"玩家","content":"等一下……这是你用蛇毒和你的能力做的？","style":2,"background":3001,"log_type":1,"src_id":130302084,"trial_step":84},{"step":85,"speaker":"选项","options":["这真的是你的梦境？"],"style":6,"background":3001,"log_type":1,"src_id":130302085,"trial_step":85,"course":3,"choices":[{"text":"这真的是你的梦境？","goto":86}]},{"step":86,"speaker":"玩家","content":"可是你的梦境……","style":2,"background":3001,"log_type":1,"src_id":130302086,"trial_step":86},{"step":87,"content":"你想说，这并不是快乐，但心脏跳得极快，仿佛快要猝过去，让你无法说出来。","style":3,"background":3001,"log_type":1,"src_id":130302087,"trial_step":87},{"step":88,"content":"你的所有感官逐渐和剧场中的人物融为一体，像是置身在这一栋无法逃出的房子里一样，你感到愤怒，不屑以及……异于常人的兴奋。","style":3,"background":3001,"log_type":1,"src_id":130302088,"trial_step":88},{"step":89,"speaker":"娜恰","content":"这是一个故事，一个剧场，不是梦露带来的美梦。","voice":["vo_trial_30302_1_44"],"voice_bank":"vo_snake_trial","style":1,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":130302089,"trial_step":89},{"step":90,"speaker":"娜恰","content":"但……你觉得这不快乐吗？","voice":["vo_trial_30302_1_45"],"voice_bank":"vo_snake_trial","style":1,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":130302090,"trial_step":90},{"step":91,"content":"娜恰笑着，看着无法动弹的你。","style":3,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":130302091,"trial_step":91},{"step":92,"speaker":"娜恰","content":"你说过，要我去找自己真正的快乐，我去找了。这就是独属于我的“快乐”！我想……让你也好好体验，然后，去拥有一个快乐的梦境……","voice":["vo_trial_30302_1_46"],"voice_bank":"vo_snake_trial","style":1,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":130302092,"trial_step":92},{"step":93,"speaker":"娜恰","content":"不要着急，我们继续体验这种感觉……你会喜欢上它的，我保证。","voice":["vo_trial_30302_1_47"],"voice_bank":"vo_snake_trial","style":1,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":130302093,"trial_step":93},{"step":94,"speaker":"娜恰","content":"但不管怎样，那个男人有一句话还是说对了的，这个地方……是当时的她，寻找快乐的惟一的路。","voice":["vo_trial_30302_1_48"],"voice_bank":"vo_snake_trial","style":1,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":130302094,"trial_step":94},{"step":95,"speaker":"娜恰","content":"所以，当这条路消失的时候，她陷入了迷茫。","voice":["vo_trial_30302_1_49"],"voice_bank":"vo_snake_trial","style":1,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":130302095,"trial_step":95},{"step":96,"speaker":"女孩","content":"我要去哪里呢？哪里才有真正的快乐呢？","voice":["vo_trial_30302_1_50"],"voice_bank":"vo_snake_trial","style":1,"background":1016,"log_type":1,"src_id":130302096,"trial_step":96},{"step":97,"content":"你看到女孩跌跌撞撞地游走在街上，毫无目的。","style":3,"background":1016,"log_type":1,"src_id":130302097,"trial_step":97},{"step":98,"content":"直到一个女人，拦住了她的去路。","style":3,"background":1016,"log_type":1,"src_id":130302098,"trial_step":98},{"step":99,"speaker":"星探","content":"哇~！小姐，我在暗……我在网上看过你的表演！","voice":["vo_trial_30302_1_51"],"voice_bank":"vo_snake_trial","style":1,"background":1016,"log_type":1,"src_id":130302099,"trial_step":99},{"step":100,"speaker":"星探","content":"实在是太刺激，太让人热血沸腾了！啧啧啧……那可是蛇啊~！","voice":["vo_trial_30302_1_52"],"voice_bank":"vo_snake_trial","style":1,"background":1016,"log_type":1,"src_id":130302100,"trial_step":100},{"step":101,"speaker":"星探","content":"如今见到本人，天，实在是太厉害了……你的眼神，你的气质，太完美了……你就是癫狂和疯魔的代言人！","voice":["vo_trial_30302_1_53"],"voice_bank":"vo_snake_trial","style":1,"background":1016,"log_type":1,"src_id":130302101,"trial_step":101},{"step":102,"speaker":"星探","content":"对于你的主……你的经纪人那件事，我感到遗憾，但不要伤心，我们可以比他更好地帮助你。","voice":["vo_trial_30302_1_54"],"voice_bank":"vo_snake_trial","style":1,"background":1016,"log_type":1,"src_id":130302102,"trial_step":102},{"step":103,"speaker":"女孩","content":"帮助我……？","voice":["vo_trial_30302_1_55"],"voice_bank":"vo_snake_trial","style":1,"background":1016,"log_type":1,"src_id":130302103,"trial_step":103},{"step":104,"speaker":"女孩","content":"你会……让我快乐吗？","voice":["vo_trial_30302_1_56"],"voice_bank":"vo_snake_trial","style":1,"background":1016,"log_type":1,"src_id":130302104,"trial_step":104},{"step":105,"speaker":"星探","content":"那当然啦！我们公司的艺人，个个生活纸醉金迷，无比快乐。","voice":["vo_trial_30302_1_57"],"voice_bank":"vo_snake_trial","style":1,"background":1016,"log_type":1,"src_id":130302105,"trial_step":105},{"step":106,"content":"剧场中，一切又在飞速的变化着，在天旋地转之间，另一方景色渐渐地显露出来。","style":3,"background":1016,"log_type":1,"src_id":130302106,"trial_step":106},{"step":107,"content":"你认出来了，那是那家娱乐公司——你在追查梦露的时候见到过。","style":3,"background":1001,"log_type":1,"src_id":130302107,"trial_step":107},{"step":108,"speaker":"星探","content":"只要你签约，要多快乐，就有多快乐！","voice":["vo_trial_30302_1_58"],"voice_bank":"vo_snake_trial","style":1,"background":1001,"log_type":1,"src_id":130302108,"trial_step":108},{"step":109,"speaker":"女孩","content":"这是你说的，我会得到快乐。","voice":["vo_trial_30302_1_59"],"voice_bank":"vo_snake_trial","style":1,"background":1001,"log_type":1,"src_id":130302109,"trial_step":109},{"step":110,"speaker":"女孩","content":"只要签约，就能得到快乐。","voice":["vo_trial_30302_1_60"],"voice_bank":"vo_snake_trial","style":1,"background":1001,"log_type":1,"src_id":130302110,"trial_step":110},{"step":111,"speaker":"星探","content":"嗯，对对对对！","voice":["vo_trial_30302_1_61"],"voice_bank":"vo_snake_trial","style":1,"background":1001,"log_type":1,"src_id":130302111,"trial_step":111},{"step":112,"content":"办公桌前，女人将笔推给面前的女孩，女孩没有犹豫，拿起笔签了下去。","style":3,"background":1001,"log_type":1,"src_id":130302112,"trial_step":112},{"step":113,"speaker":"星探","content":"很好，从今天起，你将成为我们公司旗下的艺人啦，希望你多多努力，多多创收。","voice":["vo_trial_30302_1_62"],"voice_bank":"vo_snake_trial","style":1,"background":1001,"log_type":1,"src_id":130302113,"trial_step":113},{"step":114,"speaker":"星探","content":"……和你的“搭档”一起。","voice":["vo_trial_30302_1_63"],"voice_bank":"vo_snake_trial","style":1,"background":1001,"log_type":1,"src_id":130302114,"trial_step":114},{"step":115,"content":"星探收好那份合同，指了指女孩手臂上缠着的那条小东西。","style":3,"background":1001,"log_type":1,"src_id":130302115,"trial_step":115},{"step":116,"content":"屈于女孩的能力，那条让她陷入生命危险的黑蛇，甘愿被同化成同类，缩小身躯缠绕在她手臂上。","style":3,"background":1001,"log_type":1,"src_id":130302116,"trial_step":116},{"step":117,"speaker":"艺人A","content":"有什么了不起的！还不是吃自己以前在网上什么蛇语少女的老本红利，不就是搞猎奇小众文化吗！等人们新鲜劲儿过去了，她就什么也不是了！","voice":["vo_trial_30302_1_64"],"voice_bank":"vo_snake_trial","style":1,"background":2023,"log_type":1,"src_id":130302117,"trial_step":117},{"step":118,"speaker":"艺人B","content":"哎，但人家现在数据好看啊，资源倾斜给她也是情有可原……不过，听说她还被安排去了上层人士的私人聚会？","voice":["vo_trial_30302_1_65"],"voice_bank":"vo_snake_trial","style":1,"background":2023,"log_type":1,"src_id":130302118,"trial_step":118},{"step":119,"speaker":"艺人A","content":"切，谁知道她怎么上去的！瞧她那谄媚样吧……恶心。装给谁看呢，她也不过是个赚钱工具罢了。","voice":["vo_trial_30302_1_66"],"voice_bank":"vo_snake_trial","style":1,"background":2023,"log_type":1,"src_id":130302119,"trial_step":119},{"step":120,"content":"女孩路过休息室，里面尖锐的声音传了过来。","style":3,"background":2023,"log_type":1,"src_id":130302120,"trial_step":120},{"step":121,"speaker":"艺人A","content":"工具是没有权利的，等她…………我看她面对镜头还笑不笑得出来。","voice":["vo_trial_30302_1_67"],"voice_bank":"vo_snake_trial","style":1,"background":2023,"log_type":1,"src_id":130302121,"trial_step":121},{"step":122,"content":"女孩的通讯器响了两声，经纪人的讯息跳了出来。","style":3,"background":2023,"log_type":1,"src_id":130302122,"trial_step":122},{"step":123,"speaker":"通讯消息","content":"“这次的表演很不错！你做得很好！”","style":11,"background":2023,"log_type":1,"src_id":130302123,"trial_step":123},{"step":124,"speaker":"通讯消息","content":"“所以，今天晚上，你就去市中心的私人宴会上表演吧，宴会主人很喜欢你今天的表现，想让你去助助兴。”","style":11,"background":2023,"log_type":1,"src_id":130302124,"trial_step":124},{"step":125,"speaker":"通讯消息","content":"“马上就会有人来接你，这可是难得的机会，不允许出差错。”","style":11,"background":2023,"log_type":1,"src_id":130302125,"trial_step":125},{"step":126,"speaker":"通讯消息","content":"“那个宴会很快乐的，我觉得……你一定会喜欢！”","style":11,"background":2023,"log_type":1,"src_id":130302126,"trial_step":126},{"step":127,"content":"女孩就这么盯着消息看了很久，继而砰地一声撞开了休息室的门。","style":3,"background":2023,"log_type":1,"src_id":130302127,"trial_step":127},{"step":128,"speaker":"带蛇的女孩","content":"我可不管新鲜劲儿过去之后会是什么样，总比有些人连“新鲜劲儿”都没有要好吧？","voice":["vo_trial_30302_1_68"],"voice_bank":"vo_snake_trial","style":1,"background":2023,"log_type":1,"src_id":130302128,"trial_step":128},{"step":129,"speaker":"带蛇的女孩","content":"有时间在这里说三道四，不如想想……怎么去追寻自己的快乐吧。","voice":["vo_trial_30302_1_69"],"voice_bank":"vo_snake_trial","style":1,"background":2023,"log_type":1,"src_id":130302129,"trial_step":129},{"step":130,"content":"女孩说完，头也不回地走了。","style":3,"background":2023,"log_type":1,"src_id":130302130,"trial_step":130},{"step":131,"content":"剧场上景色在飞速掠过，你和女孩像是被人牵引着，来到了市中心的最高楼。","style":3,"background":2020,"log_type":1,"src_id":130302131,"trial_step":131},{"step":132,"content":"最里层的宴会厅，被布置成灯火通明的游乐城。","style":3,"background":2020,"log_type":1,"src_id":130302132,"trial_step":132},{"step":133,"content":"可是那些宾客，无不带上丑恶的面具，化着满是疤痕的妆，以及令人作呕的衣服。","style":3,"background":2020,"log_type":1,"src_id":130302133,"trial_step":133},{"step":134,"content":"他们起哄着，让舞台上的女孩与蛇共舞。","style":3,"background":2020,"log_type":1,"src_id":130302134,"trial_step":134},{"step":135,"speaker":"宾客","content":"你是最合适的！真正的怪物！！","voice":["vo_trial_30302_1_70"],"voice_bank":"vo_snake_trial","style":1,"background":2020,"log_type":1,"src_id":130302135,"trial_step":135},{"step":136,"content":"大楼周围明明灯火辉煌，可那句话的声响过之后，很久很久，内里都不再有人说话，只有乐声。","style":3,"background":2020,"log_type":1,"src_id":130302136,"trial_step":136},{"step":137,"content":"你不由自主地抬起头来，希望强压下女孩带给你的情绪——恶心，厌恶，和不屑一顾。","style":3,"background":2020,"log_type":1,"src_id":130302137,"trial_step":137},{"step":138,"content":"女孩坐在私人宴会厅的舞台上，她的小蛇亲昵地蹭着她的脸侧，而台下东倒西歪，一片狼藉。","style":3,"background":2020,"log_type":1,"src_id":130302138,"trial_step":138},{"step":139,"speaker":"带蛇的女孩","content":"你们带给我的，为什么也不是快乐呢？她明明说过……这个宴会很快乐的。","voice":["vo_trial_30302_1_71"],"voice_bank":"vo_snake_trial","style":1,"background":2020,"log_type":1,"src_id":130302139,"trial_step":139},{"step":140,"content":"在女孩脚下，一只“怪物”瞠目结舌，看着女孩，嘴里断断续续地喊着……","style":3,"background":2020,"log_type":1,"src_id":130302140,"trial_step":140},{"step":141,"speaker":"宾客","content":"你不过……就是个工具，让我们……快活……工具……","voice":["vo_trial_30302_1_72"],"voice_bank":"vo_snake_trial","style":1,"background":2020,"log_type":1,"src_id":130302141,"trial_step":141},{"step":142,"content":"你立刻明白这是什么事了。","style":3,"background":2020,"log_type":1,"src_id":130302142,"trial_step":142},{"step":143,"speaker":"选项","options":["幻影娱乐的宾客失踪案件"],"style":6,"background":2020,"log_type":1,"src_id":130302143,"trial_step":143,"course":3,"choices":[{"text":"幻影娱乐的宾客失踪案件","goto":144}]},{"step":144,"speaker":"玩家","content":"娜恰，你越陷越深了……现在醒来，还来得及。","style":2,"background":2020,"log_type":1,"src_id":130302144,"trial_step":144},{"step":145,"speaker":"娜恰","content":"这里也无法带给她快乐，她依然……要自己寻找快乐。","voice":["vo_trial_30302_1_73"],"voice_bank":"vo_snake_trial","style":1,"background":2020,"log_type":1,"src_id":130302145,"trial_step":145},{"step":146,"content":"娜恰答非所问，不愿再开口，你只能继续看着剧场上演的场景——音乐中，灯光下，你看到女孩走进宴厅之中，拿起了一本沾满污秽的刊物。","style":3,"background":2020,"log_type":1,"src_id":130302146,"trial_step":146},{"step":147,"speaker":"带蛇的女孩","content":"蛇和女孩……猎奇……怪物……","voice":["vo_trial_30302_1_74"],"voice_bank":"vo_snake_trial","style":1,"background":2020,"log_type":1,"src_id":130302147,"trial_step":147},{"step":148,"speaker":"带蛇的女孩","content":"哈……是啊，我怎么没想到呢……我总是找不到快乐，不正是因为，我是怪物吗？","voice":["vo_trial_30302_1_75"],"voice_bank":"vo_snake_trial","style":1,"background":2020,"log_type":1,"src_id":130302148,"trial_step":148},{"step":149,"speaker":"带蛇的女孩","content":"以前，到刚才，都有人叫我怪物呀。","voice":["vo_trial_30302_1_76"],"voice_bank":"vo_snake_trial","style":1,"background":2020,"log_type":1,"src_id":130302149,"trial_step":149},{"step":150,"speaker":"带蛇的女孩","content":"是的，我没有快乐，一直到现在，我都没有找到……没办法在人类之中……找到真正属于我的快乐。","voice":["vo_trial_30302_1_77"],"voice_bank":"vo_snake_trial","style":1,"background":2020,"log_type":1,"src_id":130302150,"trial_step":150},{"step":151,"content":"女孩僵硬的脸上露出一个诡异的笑容，她继续翻阅着满是“怪物”的刊物，寻找着什么。","style":3,"background":2020,"log_type":1,"src_id":130302151,"trial_step":151},{"step":152,"speaker":"带蛇的女孩","content":"那么……那么哪里才能找到怪物的快乐呢！？哪里！？","voice":["vo_trial_30302_1_78"],"voice_bank":"vo_snake_trial","style":1,"background":2020,"log_type":1,"src_id":130302152,"trial_step":152},{"step":153,"speaker":"带蛇的女孩","content":"啊……无尽……嘉年华？","voice":["vo_trial_30302_1_79"],"voice_bank":"vo_snake_trial","style":1,"background":2020,"log_type":1,"src_id":130302153,"trial_step":153},{"step":154,"content":"你的情绪和意识愈发汹涌，枷锁在不停跳动——你感受到了女孩身上的狂厄在被挑逗激发，变得愈发危险。","style":3,"background":2020,"log_type":1,"src_id":130302154,"trial_step":154},{"step":155,"speaker":"玩家","content":"娜恰，那里不是你应该去的地方，你不是怪物。","style":2,"background":2020,"log_type":1,"src_id":130302155,"trial_step":155},{"step":156,"speaker":"玩家","content":"那里没有你想要的快乐！","style":2,"background":2020,"log_type":1,"src_id":130302156,"trial_step":156},{"step":157,"content":"可混乱的情绪不断沿着枷锁反噬进入你的体内，昏乱的感觉中，你只能听到一个声音——","style":3,"background":2020,"log_type":1,"src_id":130302157,"trial_step":157},{"step":158,"speaker":"娜恰","content":"我们一起去吧……去寻找最极致的快乐！","voice":["vo_trial_30302_1_80"],"voice_bank":"vo_snake_trial","style":1,"background":2020,"log_type":1,"src_id":130302158,"trial_step":158},{"step":159,"speaker":"玩家","content":"娜恰，我们走——","style":2,"background":2020,"log_type":1,"src_id":130302159,"trial_step":159},{"step":160,"content":"娜恰的声音带着蛊惑的意味，你几乎下意识地想要答应。","style":3,"background":2020,"log_type":1,"src_id":130302160,"trial_step":160},{"step":161,"content":"刺痛的感觉袭来——那是枷锁的警告，是你本能的预警。","style":3,"background":2020,"log_type":1,"src_id":130302161,"trial_step":161},{"step":162,"speaker":"选项","options":["我拒绝，娜恰。"],"style":6,"background":2020,"log_type":1,"src_id":130302162,"trial_step":162,"course":3,"choices":[{"text":"我拒绝，娜恰。","goto":163}]},{"step":163,"content":"裹挟上来的所有感受突然褪去，也让你看清了眼前的人。","style":3,"background":2020,"log_type":1,"src_id":130302163,"trial_step":163},{"step":164,"speaker":"娜恰","content":"……真是顽固。","voice":["vo_trial_30302_1_81"],"voice_bank":"vo_snake_trial","style":1,"background":2020,"log_type":1,"src_id":130302164,"trial_step":164},{"step":165,"content":"娜恰软软地靠在你的膝盖上，可与你十指相握的手，却勒得你有些生疼。","style":3,"background":2020,"log_type":1,"src_id":130302165,"trial_step":165},{"step":166,"speaker":"娜恰","content":"很快了……你很快就能看到了……","voice":["vo_trial_30302_1_82"],"voice_bank":"vo_snake_trial","style":1,"background":2020,"log_type":1,"src_id":130302166,"trial_step":166},{"step":167,"speaker":"玩家","content":"娜恰……你现在很虚弱，怎么回事……？！","style":2,"background":2020,"log_type":1,"src_id":130302167,"trial_step":167},{"step":168,"speaker":"玩家","content":"我不知道你对我做了什么，但你现在不能再消耗你自己了，你……","style":2,"background":2020,"log_type":1,"src_id":130302168,"trial_step":168},{"step":169,"speaker":"娜恰","content":"我明白……你为什么拒绝我的快乐，是因为这个阶段的快乐无法满足你对吗？没关系，没关系……","voice":["vo_trial_30302_1_83"],"voice_bank":"vo_snake_trial","style":1,"background":2020,"log_type":1,"src_id":130302169,"trial_step":169},{"step":170,"speaker":"娜恰","content":"马上，我们马上就能得到更大更广，更永恒的欢愉！","voice":["vo_trial_30302_1_84"],"voice_bank":"vo_snake_trial","style":1,"background":2020,"log_type":1,"src_id":130302170,"trial_step":170},{"step":171,"content":"周围的一切又开始模糊，你意识到，娜恰又要开始讲述她的故事了。","style":3,"background":2020,"log_type":1,"src_id":130302171,"trial_step":171},{"step":172,"content":"枷锁连接着眼前的禁闭者，叫嚣着危险，你亦能体会到娜恰所体会到的一切感受。","style":3,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":130302172,"trial_step":172},{"step":173,"content":"你知道，娜恰是在将自己的故事剖开放在你面前，想要拉你一起沉沦，可眼前生命正在走向衰弱的女孩依旧艰难地笑着，要让你体会她真正的快乐……","style":3,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":130302173,"trial_step":173},{"step":174,"speaker":"玩家","content":"既然你愿意剖开自己的全部，那就让我感受你的一切吧。","style":2,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":130302174,"trial_step":174}]}